---
// The big closing statement (Barlow Bold 51 at 3008px), in the right column of a <Split>.
---

<p class="statement"><slot /></p>

<style>
  p.statement {
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: max(24px, calc(51 * var(--cu)));
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
</style>
